# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# ALL source material stays local and is never published.
#
# A <user>.github.io Pages repo must be public, so anything tracked here
# is world-readable. source-material/ contains the handoff brief (which
# names the anchor customer that was explicitly decided against naming),
# the Portfolio Panel deck (unredacted clinic screenshots), her LinkedIn
# export, the full-resolution Carbonmade originals, and the Salesforce
# internal prototype repo.
#
# None of that belongs on a public URL under her name.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
source-material/

# Working documents. Local only.
#
# notes/ carries internal Salesforce identifiers (hostnames, her internal
# username) and candid strategic assessments never written for an audience.
# drafts/ carries the CV working copy with contact details and open questions.
# Neither belongs in a public repo. Move them to a private repo if they ever
# need to be shared.
notes/
drafts/
